# AUTH_SECRET= Required, at least 32 characters; keep the real value outside this example file.
# DATABASE_PATH= Optional, database location relative to the server package unless absolute.
# NODE_ENV= Optional, development, production, or test.
# PORT= Optional, listen port from 1 through 65535.
# TRUSTED_EXTENSION_IDS= Optional, comma-separated IDs; the Chrome store ID is always trusted.
# TRUST_ANY_EXTENSION_ORIGIN= Optional, true only for local development.
# TRUST_PROXY_HEADER= Optional, trusted reverse proxy header name for the client address.
# RESEND_API_KEY= Required in production, Resend API credential.
# MAIL_FROM= Required in production, sender address configured in Resend.
# MAIL_REPLY_TO= Required in production, privacy contact address used as reply-to.
# REVIEWER_EMAIL= Optional, reviewer address; must be set with REVIEWER_CODE.
# REVIEWER_CODE= Optional, six-digit reviewer code; must be set with REVIEWER_EMAIL.
